abstract: >-
  Step-by-step documentation and Python utilities
  for installing, compiling, configuring, and
  executing the Weather Research and Forecasting
  (WRF) model and the WRF Preprocessing System
  (WPS). Developed by the Atmospheric Modeling
  Group of NUMA/LAMCE at the Federal University
  of Rio de Janeiro (UFRJ), Brazil.

